!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/vocabulary/invalid/ipv4-leading-zero-rejected-expected.tn"
{
  spec: "§5.5"
  description: "RFC 3986's dec-octet grammar forbids a leading zero on a multi-digit octet; widely-used IP parsers accept this leniently (historically as octal), which is exactly the ambiguity the strict grammar rules out"
  outcome: error
  category: resolver
  type-ref: "ipv4"
}
